name issue_893_overshoot_seed9
describe issue_466_overshoot_very_low_capacity with seed 9: two retransmissions from one NACK are enqueued one at a time, as libwebrtc's ReSendPacket (issue #893)
# libwebrtc pauses video 0 ms on this seed. Main 63b80da paused 6412 ms (32.0-38.4 s): at 33.43 s one NACK's two
# resends went into the pacer together, the second enqueue's long-queue rate held the RTX the first made due, the
# 33.43 s audio went first and the RTX was dropped at the 300 ms queue, so frames from 25.47 s never completed.
# With each resend its own EnqueuePackets task, the forward link matches libwebrtc's on all 2991 packets.
duration 40s
encoder_overshoot 1.3
at 0s capacity=100kbps delay=30ms queue=300ms
seed 9
expect video.encoder_dropped > 520
expect video.pause_total_ms < 100
